cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this collection of alerting rules, please cite it as below."
title: "samber/awesome-prometheus-alerts: Collection of Prometheus alerting rules"
abstract: >-
  A curated collection of 1000+ production-ready Prometheus alerting rules covering
  90+ services and 100+ exporters, spanning host and hardware monitoring, databases,
  message brokers, proxies and service meshes, runtimes, orchestrators, CI/CD,
  network and security, storage, cloud providers and observability backends.
  Every rule ships as a copy-pasteable PromQL snippet with a documented threshold,
  and is browsable as a static website with per-exporter downloadable rule files.
type: software
